# Line endings for everything executed inside a Linux container.
#
# Every integration's image mounts a script from the Windows host and runs it
# with /bin/sh, so a CRLF checkout fails at startup with:
#
#   ./entrypoint.sh: N: set: Illegal option -
#
# core.autocrlf=true (the Windows default) rewrites LF to CRLF on checkout.
# `eol=lf` overrides that regardless of the local Git setting. The rule covers
# this directory and every integration added later, so a new integration does
# not have to remember it.

*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.dockerfile text eol=lf
